                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's about time I left a review for this...\n\nThis game isn't perfect, it has some flaws.  Menu and ground movement controls aren't the best, but I looked past them I found some of the most awe inspiring moments I have experienced so far in VR.\n\nThis game is awesome, literally.  I have a lot of VR games, but few installed at one time.  This game has been part of my installed library since purchase , and will not be uninstalled any time soon.\n\nThe dev, MuddyPixel, is constantly adding new features, extra levels and content, and listening to the community to correct any major bugs or add things that people actually want.  Each time I come back to play this, it has been improved upon, I can't commend the dev enough.  \n\nPlease keep it up because I really do think this is heading to be one of the base games in VR, and one I will return to time and time again.",
